{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Red or Blue? Your choice decides life or death.</h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a strange room, faced with two buttons.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the instructions on the screen and press a button.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no lies, but you must choose wisely.</p>  <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, a button will change the room. Other times, it will light up one of the five lamps.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If all five lamps light up, you survive.</p>  <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, not all choices are that simple.</p>  <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape this room?</p>  <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>  <br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red or Blue is a mystery game with horror elements, offering a playtime of approximately 60 minutes.</p>In the demo, you can play on normal difficulty with limited content","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523910?t=1740866727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523910?t=1740866727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523910/ac95d24fbc219e16aa25f05ae39d06470f16a3e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740866727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523910/ac95d24fbc219e16aa25f05ae39d06470f16a3e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740866727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Red or Blue? Your choice decides life or death.</h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a strange room, faced with two buttons.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the instructi